  <ol>
    <li><strong>Embroidery:</strong> letter spacing, thread colour match, centre alignment on front panel</li>
    <li><strong>Inside tags:</strong> size sticker for fitted caps; adjustable straps on others</li>
    <li><strong>Bill shape:</strong> curvature and stitching rows—common batch tell</li>
    <li><strong>Beanie length:</strong> fold depth vs listing photos</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Use <a href="/blog/kakobuy-4k-qc-video-inspection-guide/">4K QC video</a> for curved bills where stills distort perspective.
  </p>

